      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，当我正在自己的房间内休息时，\n收到了一封来自特雷森学园的邮件。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d6683b65d705dd497fdb3a05580891d9a71560fdd9496a0e8604e53e7305a58",
